    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eDiscover our\u003cstrong\u003e E14 bulbs\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003ewall light\u003c/strong\u003e, the ultimate solution to illuminate your home or business in an efficient and long-lasting way. With its industry-leading energy efficiency and light adjustability, this LED wall light is perfect for any space, saving money, energy and the environment! Easy installation into your existing fixtures. Light up your life today buy it now! \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuy your \u003cb\u003ecotton wall light \u003c/b\u003ewith E14 X2 socket today and enjoy natural and elegant lighting in your home. The lamp does \u003cstrong\u003eNOT include bulbs\u003c/strong\u003e, to review our E14 bulbs click on the button:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.factorled.com/en/132-e14-led-bulbs\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eE14 LED BULB\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSON Cotton LED Wall Light - For 2 X E14 LED\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eLED\u0026nbsp;wall light\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;is an elegant, functional lighting solution that adds a touch of style and sophistication to any indoor or outdoor space. With its refined design, this wall sconce is perfect for anyone looking for a versatile, modern lighting solution.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ewall lamp\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;with an\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eE14 lamp holder\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;requires two bulbs, which are not included. It is made of aluminium with its\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eshade\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;in\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ecotton\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eand a\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ebase\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;in\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ewood\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;that make it ideal for natural decor with an elegant feel.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-rich_text_section\"\u003eThe advantages of our wall light:\u0026nbsp;\u003cspan class=\"c-mrkdwn__br\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"p-rich_text_section\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWorld-Class Lighting:\u003c/strong\u003e With the LED Wall Light, you will enjoy exceptional lighting quality. Its compatibility with LED bulbs lets you enjoy bright, crisp light that reaches every corner of your space, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eElegant Design:\u003c/strong\u003e This wall light is not just a light source, it is a design masterpiece. Its modern, minimalist look suits any decorating style, from classic to contemporary. It adds a touch of sophistication to your interiors and leaves your guests impressed.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnergy Savings:\u003c/strong\u003e Say goodbye to high electricity bills! The Wall Light\u0026nbsp; uses the latest LED technology, which consumes less energy than traditional bulbs. Enjoy powerful lighting without compromising your budget or the planet.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Installation:\u003c/strong\u003e Forget complicated installations. With this Wall Light, fitting it is child\u0027s play. Just follow the step-by-step instructions and your new wall light will be up and running in minutes.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGuaranteed Durability\u003c/strong\u003e: This product is built with high-quality materials that ensure a long service life. You will not have to worry about replacing it constantly, which saves time and money in the long run.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLimitless Versatility:\u003c/strong\u003e Where can you use the LED Wall Light? The possibilities are endless. Enhance your living room, create a relaxing mood in your bedroom, light your hallway in style or even add it to your workspace for optimal lighting.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDo not waste any more time looking for the perfect lighting. The LED Wall Light is the definitive solution, bringing together style, efficiency and durability in a single product. It is time to take action and take your home to the next level!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUses of the\u0026nbsp;SON Cotton\u0026nbsp;LED Wall Light - For 2x E14 LED\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe LED Wall Light is extremely versatile and can be used in a wide range of spaces and situations to improve the lighting and the look of your home or workplace. Here are a few ideas on where you can use this product:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nLiving room: Install the LED\u0026nbsp;Wall Light in your living room to create a cosy, elegant atmosphere. The soft, bright LED light provides the perfect illumination for movie nights, conversations with friends or moments of relaxation.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nBedroom: Place the wall light near your bed or on the side walls for soft, relaxing lighting. It is ideal for reading a book before sleep or for creating a calm, romantic atmosphere.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nHallway: Light your hallways in an elegant, practical way with the LED Wall Light. It helps prevent accidents in the dark and adds a touch of style to your walkways.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nWorkspace: If you have a home study or an office, this wall light provides the light you need to boost productivity. Its modern design will also complement your working environment.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nDining room: Use the LED Wall Light to bring out the beauty of your dining room. You can mount it on the walls around the table to create an inviting atmosphere at mealtimes.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nBathroom: If you want a touch of elegance in your bathroom, this wall light is an excellent choice too. It provides clear, even lighting for your daily routine.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nReading areas: If you have a reading corner at home, this wall light can provide the perfect lighting for your reading time, making it more comfortable and enjoyable.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\nFront entrance: Place the wall light beside your front door to welcome guests with warm, elegant lighting.\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn short, the LED Wall Light is a versatile solution that suits almost any spot in your home or office. Its elegant design and its ability to deliver quality lighting make it an ideal addition for improving the look and the functionality of different spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e*Bulbs not included*\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt Factorled we guarantee that our products carry a QUALITY warranty and provide everything needed for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet for every LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
